### Login admin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@nexastock.dev",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### Dashboard
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear producto
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "LAP-DEV-001",
  "name": "Laptop Developer Pro 14",
  "category": "Hardware",
  "price": 1299.99,
  "stock": 15,
  "minStock": 5
}

### Listar productos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products?term=laptop&page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear cliente
POST http://localhost:8080/api/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Acme Digital SL",
  "email": "compras@acmedigital.test",
  "phone": "+34 600 100 200",
  "company": "Acme Digital SL"
}

### Crear pedido
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 2
    },
    {
      "productId": 2,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}
